      <p class="lead">Tell me the size of your team. I will show you what the human side looks like in real terms, what it is quietly costing you each year, and the risk you are carrying without knowing it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="calc" data-calc data-industries={JSON.stringify(INDUSTRIES)}>
      <div class="tile ins">
        <div class="in">
          <div class="in-row"><label for="hs-n">People on your team</label><output for="hs-n" class="big" data-o="n">{num(N0)}</output></div>
          <input class="range" type="range" id="hs-n" min="10" max="5000" step="10" value={N0} style={`--p:${((N0 - 10) / 4990) * 100}%`} />
